; SPECTRA - npm/pnpm configuration.
; Spec: Part I 33.4 (engine-strict, offline-friendly store); Part II 74.2 (pnpm
; content-addressed store baked into the toolchain image), 75.1.14 (no network
; after clone).
; Status: not started - nothing has been installed from this configuration.

engine-strict=true
prefer-offline=true
ignore-scripts=true
strict-peer-dependencies=true
recursive-install=true
store-dir=/opt/spectra/vendor/pnpm-store

; TODO(offline switch): Part II 74.2 enforces --offline / npm_config_offline=true
; inside the toolchain image rather than here, because make toolchain-refresh is
; the one target permitted to reach the network (Part II 74.1). Do not set
; offline=true in this file without moving that target's install path.
; TODO(store-dir): the path above is the in-image vendor path; a developer
; outside the devcontainer has no such directory. Decide whether this line
; belongs in the image's own .npmrc once that image exists.
